ont-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>&nbsp;<br><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:14.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:1.0000;\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><br>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">乙方通过甲方平台进行产品供应及交易服务事宜，并通过甲方自行接入的第三方支付系统办理订单支付、交易退款及结算事宜，依照中华人民共和国的法律法规，甲乙双方在平等互利、真诚合作、共同发展的基础上，经友好协商，达成如下协议条款：</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\">第一条、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">合作方式</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">：</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:28.0000pt;\nmso-char-indent-count:2.0000;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">甲方提供销售平台，乙方将商品上传至</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">商城</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">进行</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">自行</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">售卖</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">成功生成交易订单后，</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">由乙方自行发货。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:28.0000pt;\nmso-char-indent-count:2.0000;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">委托甲方进行售卖，甲方</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">/</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">客户到乙方</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">处</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">自</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">行</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">提</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">取</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">货物</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">，其他发货方式由甲乙双方协商解决</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:0.0000pt;\nmso-char-indent-count:0.0000;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\">第二条、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">合作时间</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">：</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">本合同自甲乙双方授权代表签署后，合同即开始生效，合同有效期</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">年</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">：</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">自</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u>#开始时间#<u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">月</font></span><span style=\"text-indent: 56pt; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: 56pt; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">至</font></span><u style=\"text-indent: 56pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></u>#结束时间#<u style=\"text-indent: 56pt;\"></u><span style=\"text-indent: 56pt; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">日止。</font></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">第三条、甲方权利与义务</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">1、甲方负责对乙方进行</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">平台</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">使用培训，并在合同期内向乙方提供技术支持和后期维护，确保系统正常运行。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">2、甲方有权根据市场和发展需要，在保证乙方资料、数据安全的前提下，对应用系统进行升级或修改，无需获得乙方的同意，每次系统升级后，甲方将通过</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">应用及官方网站发布更新告知。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">3、甲方须保证乙方数据的安全性，不得将乙方的数据透露或转让给第三方 ，如因此类行为造成乙方及所管辖项目业主信息或数据泄露或损失的，甲方须承担法律规定的赔偿责任。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">第四条、乙方权利与义务</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">1、乙方在甲方</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">商城</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">上自主</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">经营</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">或</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">提供</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">的产品，要保证合法经营</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">，乙方必须保证所提供产品质量符合国家法律法规，因乙方提供产品质量不合格，造成的一切经济损失及法律责任，由乙方全部承担，与甲方无关。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">2、乙方负责对所上传商品的信息进行及时更新和维护，确保所上传商品信息真实、准确。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">3、乙方应妥善管理</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">分配的后台账号，并对使用该账号所进行的活动负完全责任。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">4、乙方若发现任何非法使用其账户或存在安全漏洞的情况，请立即通告甲方。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">5、甲乙双方都不得通过</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">德宏商城</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">发布违法或虚假信息，一经发现，违约一方应立即删除，如因违约一方原因造成另一方被处罚或利益受损的，违约一方应承担全部责任及赔偿另一方的直接经济损失。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">6、乙方保证在使用服务进行交易的过程中遵守诚实信用的原则，不</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">在交易过程中采取不正当竞争行为，不扰乱正常秩序，不从事与交易无关的行为。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">7、乙方在本合同期内，应提供好的产品及服务，保证维护甲方的良好声誉和企业形象 ，不得做出任何有损于甲方之品牌形象和声誉的任何言论及行动。如甲方发现乙方有故意诋毁或损害甲方声誉的言行或行为，甲方有权立即终止本协议，并将视情节追究乙方法律责任。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">第五条、收益分配</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">（参考附件）</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">1、在合同期内，乙方每年需向甲方提</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">平台使用费</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">元。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">2、为了保证消费者的根本利益，同时为了更好的取信于民，乙方应交纳质量诚信保证金</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">元，作为假一赔三的专项资金，合同期满后</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">10</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">个工作日内结算退回。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">3、平台交易手续费按销售额的%进行结算，由乙方向甲方结算。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">4、</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">在合同期限内，乙方在甲方平台上售卖的商品</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">所获得的</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">收益</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">，按商品</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">销售额的</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">分配给甲方。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">5、分销佣金分配方式：如商品是由分销员售出，分销机制支持两级分销，如有两级分销按照一级佣金销售额%，二级佣金销售额%，如有一级分销按照一级佣金销售额2%，由乙方向分销员支付。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">6、甲方根据乙方需求行技术支持，如：店铺装修等，按需支付给甲方相关费用。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">7</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">、乙方</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">商品费用</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">甲方于</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">每月</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">日</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">节假日顺延）</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">由甲乙双方审核上月成交订单详情，经双方核对签字后，甲方转账给乙方（乙方需提供发票）。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">6</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">、账户信息</font> </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>1）甲方账户信息</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">开户名称</font>∶</span></b></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">开户银行</font>∶</span></b></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">银行账号</font>∶</span></b></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">乙方账户信息</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">开户名称</font>∶</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">开户银行</font>∶</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">银行账号</font>∶ </span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">第六条、协议的解除</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">1、有下列情形之一的，甲方有权终止乙方部分或全部服务并解除本协议∶</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>1）乙方在合作期间内存在不正当竞争行为，扰乱甲方平台交易秩序的。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>2）乙方发布违法或虚假信息或广告造成甲方损失的。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>3）乙方因违法被取缔或自行停业的。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">2、有下列情形之一的，乙方有权终止与甲方的协议∶</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>1）甲方故意泄露或贩卖乙方所管辖项目业主信息给第三方的。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>2）甲方发布违法或虚假信息造成乙方损失的。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>3）甲方因违法被取缔或自行停业的。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">风险提示</font>∶</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">合同的约定虽然细致，但无法保证合作方不违约。因此，必须明确约定违约条款，一旦一方违约，另一方则能够以此作为追偿依据。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">第七条、违约责任在合作期内，项目合作双方中任一方未经其对方协商认可擅自退出该合作项目</font> ，违约方同时赔偿被侵害方的投入损失及其他合作期内应得收益。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">第八条、不可抗力</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">：</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">因不可抗力或者其他意外事件，使得本协议不能履行的，甲乙双方均不承担违约责任</font>;本合同所称之不可抗力包括但不限于战争、台风、水灾、地震、罢工、暴动、法定流行疾病、黑客攻击、网络病毒、电信部门技术管制、互联网中断、系统故障、政</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">府行为或其他自然或人为灾难等客观情况。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">第九条、其他</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">1、因本协议所引起的任何纠纷或争议，首先应协商解决，协商不成的，双方同意通过法律途径诉讼解决，应向</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">人民法院提起诉讼</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">2、如有未尽事宜或变动事项，经双方协商一致后，可签订补充协议。补充协议中若有修改原条款的，修改后的条款则优于原条款，未修改部分维持原条款不变。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">3、协议一式</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">贰</font></span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">份，甲乙双方各执</font></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">壹</font></span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">份，具有同等法律效力，本协议自甲乙双方签章之日起生效。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">第十条</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<font face=\"宋体\">、附件</font>1（德宏商城资费标准）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">甲方</font>∶</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"宋体\">乙方：</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:normal;\nmso-bidi-font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">法人或授权代表：</font></span><span style=\